            {
              "content": "**CH0:** 180° servo, dial or Setpoints. **CH1:** 270° position servo. **CH2 / port 2:** auger, continuous rotation. **CH3:** second continuous motor.\n\nUse **Reverse**, **Stop**, and **Forward** below for the auger, or adjust its speed. **0% stops**; positive and negative turn opposite ways. Disable servos or use **Stop / release all** to stop and release every output. The auger starts stopped after reboot and does not restart when enabled.\n\nRequested positions and speeds are commands, not measured motion.",
              "type": "markdown"
            },
