          "content": "### Servo connections\n**CH0:** 180° position servo. **CH1:** 270° position servo. **CH2 / port 2:** continuous-rotation auger. **CH3:** second continuous motor.\n\nSignal/PWM, V+, GND on each; check polarity. External servo power: **4.8–6 V**, common ground. Power off before wiring. The printed card below predates CH1–CH3. The auger starts stopped.",
